</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">논문안내에서 확인가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제출방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">메일제출</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(mintsaw@kumoh.ac.kr)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">위의 제출서류 파일명은 학번성명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.hwp</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">파일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(ex: 20134123</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">홍길동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.hwp)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">메일 제출 후 대학원 검증 받은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">메일답장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">후 도서관 홈페이지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">dcollection </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">프로그램에</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">원문파일 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">위 메일제출은 학위논문 양식을 확인하는 절차이며 표지확인 업무는 대학원지원팀의 의무사항이 아닙니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">답 메일을 받으셨더라도 본인이 반드시 제목 및 형식을 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">최종본은 결과보고서의 제목과 반드시 동일하여야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">본인의 대학원명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">심사위원 등을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2018. 06.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육 및 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
